# yaml-cpp 0.8 soname shim: the pinned calamares-3.4.0 was built against
# yaml-cpp 0.8 (libyaml-cpp.so.0.8) but extra now ships yaml-cpp 0.9
# (libyaml-cpp.so.0.9), so calamares failed to start with
# "libyaml-cpp.so.0.8: cannot open shared object file". Ships the genuine 0.8 lib.
yaml-cpp08-shim
calamares
# Keyboard-layout preview for the Calamares keyboard page (from mikalinux-repo)
ckbcomp

# added package for plasma
# Display manager. plasma-meta 6.6 demoted sddm from a hard dependency to an
# optdepend, so it stopped being pulled in automatically and the live ISO booted
# to a black screen (display-manager.service -> /usr/bin/sddm = status 203/EXEC,
# binary missing). ALWAYS list the display manager explicitly so a desktop ISO
# can never silently lose it again on an upstream dependency change.
sddm
sddm-kcm
plasma-nm
kate
packagekit-qt6

